JSON -- JSON encoding and decoding
**********************************

Description
===========

JSON (see https://www.json.org/ ) (JavaScript Object Notation) is a common data
interchange format.  This package provides two methods, *note toJSON: toJSON,
and *note fromJSON: fromJSON,, for converting Macaulay2 things to valid JSON
data and vice versa.

+----------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : toJSON {hashTable{"foo" => "bar"}, 1, 3.14159, true, false, null}|
|                                                                      |
|o1 = [{"foo": "bar"}, 1, 3.14159, true, false, null]                  |
+----------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : fromJSON oo                                                      |
|                                                                      |
|o2 = {HashTable{"foo" => bar}, 1, 3.14159, true, false, }             |
|                                                                      |
|o2 : List                                                             |
+----------------------------------------------------------------------+

